  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Greeting By Billy**: rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n- **The Lonesome River**: rare: 11 archived performances [4]\n- ***Lonely At The Top**: rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- ***John Henry**: back after 134 archived shows (913 days); rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **#Country Blues**: rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n- **Ridin' On That Midnight Train**: back after 132 archived shows (909 days); rare: 4 archived performances [4]\n- **Four Sticks**: back after 56 archived shows (406 days); rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **Doin' Things Wrong**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2025-06-07** (recommended): source not stated; 30 songs; 153 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **billystrings_6-7-25_allstate_202506**: source not stated; 0 songs; 154 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer says this was their 33rd Billy Strings show [3]\n- Notes label this recording show number 143 of 2025 for the taper [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2025-06-07**: taped by Z-Man; transferred by Z-Man; source: Schoeps CCM4V'S>Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II (48/32) [1]. Also: Reviewer says the recording was made by the taper Z-Man; Recorded with Schoeps CCM4V microphones into a Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II at 48kHz/32-bit, then processed in Sound Forge and converted to FLAC; Taped by Z-Man from Section 103, Row AA, Seat 2, with microphones 7.5 feet high; Tim Donahue assisted [1][3]\n- **billystrings_6-7-25_allstate_202506**: taped by Tony DeStefanis [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Allstate Arena 2025 - Run Poster Foil - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/allstate-arena-2025-run-poster-foil/) [5]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Allstate Arena 2025 - Run Poster Foil - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/allstate-arena-2025-run-poster-foil/) [6]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Allstate Arena 2025 - N1 Regular Poster - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/allstate-arena-2025-n1-regular-poster/) [7]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Allstate Arena 2025 – N1 Poster Foil - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/allstate-arena-2025-n1-poster-foil/) [8]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Allstate Arena 2025 – N2 Poster Foil - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/allstate-arena-2025-n2-poster-foil/) [9]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Allstate Arena Chicago 2 Day Run Poster Rainbow Foil - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/allstate-arena-chicago-2-day-run-poster-rainbow-foil/) [10]",
